# Battleground talk by bracket: Abermenai 15-19, Thidranki 20-24, Murdaigean 25-29, Caledonia 30-35,
# Cathal Valley 45-49 (world database). "We're there now" lines need in_rvr; the rest are plans and
# memories. Adds to rvr.lines (topic battlegrounds). New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

